t me find the icon tiles. Let me read the nametable row for the HUD and find non-blank tiles that repeat 3 times.\n\nLet me read_nametable x=0,y=3,width=32,height=3. Earlier I read (16,5) and got blanks. Let me read the full HUD row.\n\nLet me read x=0,y=3,width=32,height=3.\n\nHmm, earlier read at (16,5)-(31,7) showed tile 36 (blank) mostly, with palette 1. The HUD icons might be at x<16. Let me read x=0,y=3,width=16,height=3.\n\nLet me do it."}
